# A02: placa 100x60x10 con 4 agujeros Ø6,6 -> V = 60000 - 4*pi*3.3^2*10 = 58631.52 mm3
# Datos, consulta, vista, selección, edición de operaciones, documentos y exportación.
@d = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
@k = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
@r = se_sketch {"action":"rectangle","sketch":"{{k.sketch}}","points":[0,0,100,60]}
se_sketch {"action":"info","sketch":"{{k.sketch}}"}
se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{k.sketch}}"}
@e = se_extrude {"sketch":"{{k.sketch}}","distance":10}
?= e.volume 60000
@top = se_geometry {"action":"faces","direction":[0,0,1]}
@h = se_hole {"plane":"{{top.items[0].handle}}","centers":[10,10,10,90,10,10,10,50,10,90,50,10],"diameter":6.6}
?= h.volume 58631.52 0.05
@g = se_geometry {"action":"summary"}
?= g.faces 10
?= g.boundingBox.size[0] 100
@tree = se_feature_tree {}
@ph = se_physical {"density":7850}
?= ph.volume 58631.52 0.05
@cyl = se_geometry {"action":"faces","type":"cylinder"}
?= cyl.count 4
@m = se_measure {"action":"distance","first":"{{cyl.items[0].handle}}","second":"{{cyl.items[1].handle}}"}
@top2 = se_geometry {"action":"faces","direction":[0,0,1]}
@side = se_geometry {"action":"faces","direction":[1,0,0]}
@ma = se_measure {"action":"angle","first":"{{top2.items[0].handle}}","second":"{{side.items[0].handle}}"}
@edges = se_geometry {"action":"edges","source":"{{top2.items[0].handle}}","type":"line"}
?= edges.count 4
se_material {"action":"libraries"}
@ml = se_material {"action":"list","filter":"Steel"}
@ap = se_material {"action":"apply","name":"Steel"}
@cur = se_material {"action":"current"}
@vl = se_variables {"action":"list"}
@va = se_variables {"action":"add","name":"Thick","value":10}
@vg = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Thick"}
?= vg.value 10
# límites (fuera de ellos Solid Edge conserva el valor sin avisar: la herramienta da value_rejected), comentario, exponer y renombrar
@lr = se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","min":5,"max":20}
?= lr.limits.type range
?= lr.limits.max 20
! [value_rejected] se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":25}
@s20 = se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":20}
?= s20.variable.value 20
se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","min":5,"max":20,"minExclusive":true}
! [value_rejected] se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":5}
@lv = se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","values":[10,20,30]}
?= lv.limits.type values
?= lv.limits.values[2] 30
! [value_rejected] se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":25}
se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":30}
! [invalid_argument] se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","min":5,"max":20,"values":[10]}
@lb = se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","min":20,"max":30,"minExclusive":true,"maxExclusive":true}
?= lb.limits.minExclusive true
! [value_rejected] se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":20}
@lm = se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick","min":20}
?= lm.limits.min 20
se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":200}
se_variables {"action":"limits","name":"Thick"}
@s25 = se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Thick","value":25}
?= s25.variable.value 25
@cm = se_variables {"action":"comment","name":"Thick","comment":"espesor de la placa"}
?~ cm.comment espesor de la placa
@ex = se_variables {"action":"expose","name":"Thick","exposeName":"Espesor"}
?= ex.exposedAs Espesor
@rn = se_variables {"action":"rename","name":"Thick","newName":"Espesor2"}
?= rn.name Espesor2
! [not_found] se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Thick"}
@dims = se_variables {"action":"list","kind":"dimension","filter":"ExtrudedProtrusion*"}
@rd = se_variables {"action":"rename","name":"{{dims.variables[0].name}}","newName":"Espesor_placa"}
?= rd.kind dimension
?= rd.value 10
se_variables {"action":"delete","name":"Espesor2"}
se_properties {"action":"set","name":"Project","value":"MCP acceptance"}
@pl = se_properties {"action":"list","set":"Custom"}
?~ pl MCP acceptance
# sin 'set', todos los conjuntos (alguno trae propiedades sin nombre; antes daba internal_error)
se_properties {"action":"set","set":"SummaryInformation","name":"Title","value":"A02 title"}
@pa = se_properties {"action":"list"}
?~ pa A02 title
?~ pa ProjectInformation
se_properties {"action":"delete","name":"Project"}
# cambiar una variable caduca las caras: se vuelven a consultar
@top2 = se_geometry {"action":"faces","direction":[0,0,1]}
se_selection {"action":"set","handles":["{{top2.items[0].handle}}"]}
@sel = se_selection {"action":"get"}
?= sel.count 1
se_selection {"action":"clear"}
se_view {"action":"orient","orientation":"iso"}
se_view {"action":"render_mode","mode":"seRenderModeSmoothVHL"}
! [not_supported] se_view {"action":"render_mode","mode":"seRenderModeSmoothBoundary"}
se_view {"action":"fit"}
@cap = se_view {"action":"capture","width":800,"height":600,"path":"{{work}}\\plate.png"}
@sup = se_feature_edit {"feature":"{{h.feature.handle}}","action":"suppress"}
?= sup.volume 58973.64 0.05
@uns = se_feature_edit {"feature":"{{h.feature.handle}}","action":"unsuppress"}
?= uns.volume 58631.52 0.05
se_feature_edit {"feature":"{{e.feature.handle}}","action":"rename","name":"Base"}
@tr2 = se_feature_tree {}
?~ tr2 Base
se_documents {"action":"recompute"}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\plate.par","overwrite":true}
se_export {"path":"{{work}}\\plate.stp","overwrite":true}
se_export {"path":"{{work}}\\plate.stl","overwrite":true}
se_export {"path":"{{work}}\\plate.x_t","overwrite":true}
se_export {"path":"{{work}}\\plate.igs","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"save_copy_as","path":"{{work}}\\plate_copy.par","overwrite":true}
! se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\plate.par"}
se_documents {"action":"close","document":"{{d.handle}}","saveChanges":false}
@o = se_documents {"action":"open","path":"{{work}}\\plate_copy.par"}
@inf = se_documents {"action":"info"}
@ph2 = se_physical {}
?= ph2.volume 58631.52 0.05
# deshacer y rehacer: borrar un agujero y recuperarlo
@tr3x = se_feature_tree {}
@del = se_feature_edit {"feature":"{{tr3x.features[8].handle}}","action":"delete"}
?= del.volume 58973.64 0.05
se_documents {"action":"undo"}
@ph3 = se_physical {}
?= ph3.volume 58631.52 0.05
se_documents {"action":"redo"}
@ph4 = se_physical {}
?= ph4.volume 58973.64 0.05
se_documents {"action":"close","document":"{{o.handle}}","saveChanges":false}
se_documents {"action":"list"}
